{
  "slug": "agent-memory",
  "name": "Agent Memory",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Save 60-90% on LLM token costs with intelligent memory compression. agent-memory automatically compresses tool output into structured observations, shares context across agents via a memory bus, and injects only relevant memory into each prompt — keeping your token budget under control. Features: auto-compression hooks (PostToolUse), token-budgeted context injection (SessionStart), semantic search via FTS5, cross-session persistence, and a token economics dashboard showing compression ratios and savings.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **2 hooks** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `memory-search` (Search past work and observations across sessions)\n- **Hooks** (2): `PostToolUse`, `SessionStart`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `agent-memory`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install agent-memory@claude-community` from `Keshab0310/agent-memory`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 1,
    "hook": 2,
    "mcp": 1
  },
